<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1453_5205.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Unsern</unclear> fründtlich willig <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dinst</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sambt</unclear> was wir
